## #01 — Method
Read the target contract as if you had to implement a consumer of it. Try to construct a sequence of files and events where a reader would believe a review or acceptance exists when it does not, or where two editable copies of a return could diverge. Say which sentence of the contract allows it, and what single rule would stop it.

## #02 — Case C01
A review template is copied into the investigation page before any return arrives. What tells a later reader it is not a review?

## #03 — Case C02
A return arrives, is captured, and is then edited on the investigation page to fix a typo. Which record wins, and how would anyone notice?

## #04 — Case C03
The Director replies informally in chat and nobody records it. What does 06.01.review.md show, and is that safe?

## Scoring
Unscored. State the qualitative result. Do not invent a number.

